  "materiKomponenL1KomBreadboardContent0Text": "Breadboard is alat prototipe for merangkai rangkaian elektronik tanpa menyolder. Memahami pola koneksinya penting agar rangkaian not salah sambung.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomBreadboardContent1Text": "Key points:\n- Jalur biru and merah menandai baris that terhubung.\n- Celah tengah memisahkan two sisi, cocok for memasang IC.\n- Adjacent pins are not necessarily connected, check the pattern.\n- Use multimeter continuity mode to test connection.\n- Available in 400 and 830 pin types.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomBreadboardDescription": "Breadboard is papan for merangkai komponen elektronik tanpa solder, with pola koneksi pin that already ditentukan.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomBreadboardVideoSummary0Heading": "Bab 1: Struktur Breadboard",
  "materiKomponenL1KomBreadboardVideoSummary1Text": "Breadboard terdiri from deretan pin that connected internally with a certain pattern. Blue and red tracks show mutually connected rows.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomBreadboardVideoSummary2Text": "Terdapat two breadboard types with different pin counts, around 400 pin and 830 pin, but working principle is the same.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomBreadboardVideoSummary3Heading": "Bab 2: Pola Koneksi and Celah Tengah",
  "materiKomponenL1KomBreadboardVideoSummary4Text": "Pin that adjacent not yet tentu terhubung because there is celah pembatas at bagian tengah. Jalur koneksi umumnya horizontal at sisi pinggir and vertikal at bagian tengah.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomBreadboardVideoSummary5Text": "Celah tengah dimanfaatkan for memasang IC agar pin kiri and kanan IC not saling terhubung.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomBreadboardVideoSummary6Heading": "Bab 3: Pengujian and Penggunaan",
  "materiKomponenL1KomBreadboardVideoSummary7Text": "Multimeter (avometer) with fungsi continuity test can used for memeriksa apakah pin-pin breadboard saling terhubung.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomBreadboardVideoSummary8Text": "Breadboard used for make prototipe rangkaian tanpa menyolder, sehingga memudahkan perubahan and pengujian.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomHukumOhmContent0Text": "Ohm's Law menghubungkan arus, tegangan, and hambatan in rangkaian listrik. formula dasarnya: I = V / R.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomHukumOhmContent1Text": "Key points:\n- Current is directly proportional to voltage.\n- Current is inversely proportional to resistance.\n- Units: I (ampere), V (volt), R (ohm).\n- Can be used to calculate one value if the other two are known.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomHukumOhmDescription": "Ohm's Law menjelaskan hubungan antara arus, tegangan, and hambatan in rangkaian listrik, with formula I = V / R.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomHukumOhmVideoSummary0Heading": "Bab 1: Pengertian Ohm's Law",
  "materiKomponenL1KomHukumOhmVideoSummary1Text": "Ohm's Law is prinsip dasar elektronika that menjelaskan hubungan antara arus listrik (I), tegangan (V), and hambatan (R) in suatu rangkaian.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomHukumOhmVideoSummary2Text": "Arus that mengalir through konduktor berbanding lurus with tegangan that diberikan and berbanding terbalik with hambatannya.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomHukumOhmVideoSummary3Heading": "Bab 2: formula Ohm's Law",
  "materiKomponenL1KomHukumOhmVideoSummary4Text": "Rumusnya is I = V / R, with I in ampere, V in volt, and R in ohm.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomHukumOhmVideoSummary5Heading": "Bab 3: example Soal",
  "materiKomponenL1KomHukumOhmVideoSummary6Text": "First example is calculating arus that mengalir through sebuah lamp with hambatan and tegangan tertentu.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomHukumOhmVideoSummary7Text": "Second example is calculating tegangan that needed for produce arus tertentu on hambatan tertentu.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomKapasitorContent0Text": "Kapasitor stores and releases electrical energy. Its functions include maintaining voltage stability, filtering signals, and frequency tuning.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomKapasitorContent1Text": "Key points:\n- Struktur: two metal plates with dielectric material between them.\n- Ceramic type for small capacitance and high frequency.\n- Polyester type for audio.\n- Elco and solid capacitor polarized, install according to lead positif and negatif.\n- Variable capacitor for radio frequency tuning.\n- Value range from pF to F.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomKapasitorDescription": "Kapasitor is komponen that stores and releases electrical energy with cepat, with type determined by its dielectric material.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomKapasitorVideoSummary0Heading": "Bab 1: Pengertian Kapasitor",
  "materiKomponenL1KomKapasitorVideoSummary10Text": "Pemasangan kapasitor polarized with terbalik can menyebabkan kerusakan, bahkan ledakan.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomKapasitorVideoSummary1Text": "Kapasitor is komponen elektronik that mampu menyimpan and melepas energi listrik secara cepat. Komponen ini terdiri from two metal plates that dipisahkan oleh material dielektrik that not menghantarkan listrik.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomKapasitorVideoSummary2Text": "material dielektrik menentukan Type kapasitor, misalnya keramik, kertas, or poliester.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomKapasitorVideoSummary3Heading": "Bab 2: Type-Type Kapasitor",
  "materiKomponenL1KomKapasitorVideoSummary4Text": "Kapasitor keramik common ditemui, berkapasitansi small, and sering dipakai for frekuensi tinggi. Kapasitor poliester banyak dipakai on aplikasi audio.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomKapasitorVideoSummary5Text": "Kapasitor elektrolitik (Elco) and solid capacitor memiliki kapasitansi besar and polarized, sehingga harus dipasang with benar. Solid capacitor lebih tahan panas and awet, banyak dipakai at motherboard komputer.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomKapasitorVideoSummary6Text": "Variable capacitor can diatur nilainya secara mekanis and sering dipakai for penyetelan frekuensi on radio.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomKapasitorVideoSummary7Text": "Superkapasitor memiliki kapasitansi hingga ratusan farad and berpotensi menggantikan baterai on beberapa aplikasi.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomKapasitorVideoSummary8Heading": "Bab 3: Rentang Kapasitansi and Keselamatan",
  "materiKomponenL1KomKapasitorVideoSummary9Text": "Kapasitansi kapasitor bervariasi from beberapa pikofarad (pF) hingga ratusan farad (F).",
  "materiKomponenL1KomLedContent0Text": "LED (Light Emitting Diode) is diode that emit light. Berbeda with lamp incandescent, LED produce light through recombination electron and charge carrier at in semiconductor, sehingga lebih efficient and lebih durable.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomLedContent1Text": "Key points:\n- Color LED determined by material semiconductor.\n- Forward voltage (Vf) berbeda for each Color.\n- Beam angle and intensity light can selected according to need.\n- Lead LED has polarity, and Lead long usually is anoda.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomLedContent2Text": "Type LED: through-hole (common, 5 mm), SMD (small and thin), high power (needs heatsink), COB (banyak chip in satu modul), RGB (multi-Color), and alfanumerik (display angka and huruf).",
  "materiKomponenL1KomLedDescription": "LED is diode that emit light saat dialiri listrik, with Color and tegangan kerja that determined by material semikonduktornya.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomLedVideoSummary0Heading": "Bab 1: Pengenalan LED",
  "materiKomponenL1KomLedVideoSummary1Text": "LED not lamp ordinary like lamp incandescent, melainkan Type diode that emit light when supplied with electricity. LED terbuat from material semiconductor tipe P and tipe N, and light dihasilkan saat electron and charge carrier bertemu.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomLedVideoSummary2Heading": "Bab 2: Color, Tegangan, and Karakteristik",
  "materiKomponenL1KomLedVideoSummary3Text": "Color light LED determined by material pembuatnya, that juga menentukan panjang gelombang and tegangan kerja. Contohnya, LED biru biasanya membutuhkan Forward voltage lebih tinggi dibanding LED merah.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomLedVideoSummary4Text": "Karakteristik lain that perlu diperhatikan is Beam angle light (around 10° sampai 120°) and intensity light that diukur in millicandela.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomLedVideoSummary5Heading": "Bab 3: Type-Type LED",
  "materiKomponenL1KomLedVideoSummary6Text": "LED through-hole is tipe that common with size usually 5 mm, easy to install, and polaritasnya mudah dikenali from panjang Lead.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomLedVideoSummary7Text": "LED SMD berukuran sangat small and thin, cocok for pemasangan massal on ruang terbatas. LED high power sangat terang but produce panas sehingga requires heatsink.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomLedVideoSummary8Text": "LED COB menggabungkan banyak chip in satu modul small. LED RGB terdiri from three Color dasar merah, hijau, and biru that can dikontrol secara independen for produce berbagai Color.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomLedVideoSummary9Text": "LED alfanumerik used sebagai tampilan angka and huruf on berbagai alat elektronik.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomResistorContent0Text": "value resistor dibaca from kode Color gelang. for resistor at bawah 1 ohm, gelang pengali bernilai pecahan, sehingga value akhirnya bisa berupa desimal.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomResistorContent2Text": "Key points:\n- two gelang first is digit signifikan.\n- Gelang third is pengali.\n- Gelang emas menandakan toleransi 5%.\n- Metode that sama berlaku from 1 kiloohm hingga 1 gigaohm.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomResistorDescription": "way calculating value resistor with kode Color, termasuk resistor at bawah 1 ohm menggunakan metode second.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomResistorTitle": "Resistor (way calculating value)",
  "materiKomponenL1KomResistorVideoSummary0Heading": "Bab 1: Metode second for Resistor",
  "materiKomponenL1KomResistorVideoSummary1Text": "Video ini membahas way second calculating value resistor, khususnya resistor with value at bawah 1 ohm, menggunakan tabel khusus.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomResistorVideoSummary2Text": "Metode ini menyediakan two way perhitungan, yaitu way konvensional and way menggunakan bilangan berpangkat. Hasil keduanya sama.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomResistorVideoSummary3Heading": "Bab 2: example Perhitungan",
  "materiKomponenL1KomResistorVideoSummary4Text": "Contohnya is resistor with gelang hijau, hitam, silver, and emas. Color hijau bernilai 5, hitam bernilai 0, and silver sebagai pengali bernilai 0,01.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomResistorVideoSummary5Text": "Perhitungannya is 50 x 0,01 = 0,5 ohm, with toleransi 5% that ditandai gelang emas.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomResistorVideoSummary6Heading": "Bab 3: Cakupan Metode",
  "materiKomponenL1KomResistorVideoSummary7Text": "Metode ini juga berlaku for semua resistor with rentang value from 1 kiloohm sampai 1 gigaohm.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomTactileSwitchContent0Text": "Tactile switch is push button small that memberikan sinyal on saat ditekan and off saat dilepas. Cocok for input tombol on rangkaian elektronik small.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomTactileSwitchContent1Text": "Key points:\n- Sifatnya momentary (tekan for on, lepas for off).\n- Tegangan kerja DC around 4,5 sampai 12 V.\n- Arus maksimum around 100 mA.\n- not disarankan for rangkaian AC.\n- common dipakai on remote control and perangkat elektronik small.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomTactileSwitchDescription": "Tactile switch is saklar tekan small that aktif saat ditekan and off saat dilepas, common dipakai on rangkaian DC tegangan rendah.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomTactileSwitchTitle": "Tactile Switch (Push Button)",
  "materiKomponenL1KomTactileSwitchVideoSummary0Heading": "Bab 1: Pengenalan Saklar Mini Tactile",
  "materiKomponenL1KomTactileSwitchVideoSummary1Text": "Saklar mini or tactile switch, juga dikenal sebagai micro switch, berukuran sangat small and berfungsi sebagai saklar tekan (push button).",
  "materiKomponenL1KomTactileSwitchVideoSummary2Text": "Saklar ini bekerja secara momentary: on saat ditekan and off saat dilepas.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomTactileSwitchVideoSummary3Heading": "Bab 2: Pin and Prinsip Kerja",
  "materiKomponenL1KomTactileSwitchVideoSummary4Text": "Saklar ini umumnya memiliki four pin, but prinsip kerjanya sederhana with two kutub. two pin biasanya berpasangan secara paralel sehingga stabil secara mekanis and listrik.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomTactileSwitchVideoSummary5Text": "Terdapat variasi bentuk batang, from panjang, pendek, hingga pipih, sesuai need desain.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomTactileSwitchVideoSummary6Heading": "Bab 3: Batasan and Aplikasi",
  "materiKomponenL1KomTactileSwitchVideoSummary7Text": "Saklar used on rangkaian DC with tegangan around 4,5 sampai 12 volt and arus maksimum around 100 mA.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomTactileSwitchVideoSummary8Text": "Saklar ini jarang used on rangkaian AC because alasan keselamatan and peruntukannya for sirkuit DC small.",
  "materiKomponenL1KomTactileSwitchVideoSummary9Text": "Saklar ditemukan on remote control, TV lama, and set-top box. Pemasangannya dilakukan on PCB, or breadboard for eksperimen.",
  "materiL1L1KomBreadboardContent0Text": "Breadboard is alat prototipe for merangkai rangkaian elektronik tanpa menyolder. Memahami pola koneksinya penting agar rangkaian not salah sambung.",
